    "title": "Detect swimming pools",
    "description": "YOLO11 medium object detector for outdoor swimming pools in very-high-resolution RGB imagery. The weights are those of mozilla-ai/swimming-pool-detector (trained on 512 px Mapbox zoom-18 tiles with OSM leisure=swimming_pool labels), exported unchanged to ONNX at 512 x 512. Each chip is resized once to 512 x 512 and divided by 255 (the graph has no normalisation), then one ONNX pass runs; the confidence filter, non-maximum suppression, mapping back to chip pixels and georeferencing run in the pinned spd-hot library. The resize does not read the chip zoom, so the scale matches the training data only at zoom 18, where a 256 px chip resized to 512 has the ground resolution the model was trained at.",
    "mlm:name": "yolo11m-swimming-pools",
